  "_id": "index-zeniff",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "father of Noah3, grandfather of Limhi, Mosiah 7:9. Ammon1 comes to inquire after brethren whom Zeniff brought from Zarahemla, Mosiah 7:13. overzealous to inherit land of fathers, Mosiah 7:21 (9:3). is made king, Mosiah 7:21. is deceived by King Laman2, Mosiah 7:21 (9:6–13; 10:18). record of Zeniff, Mosiah 9–22. is sent as spy among Lamanites, Mosiah 9:1. becomes leader of group, Mosiah 9:2–3. covenants with King Laman2 to possess land of Lehi-Nephi, Mosiah 9:6–7. drives out Lamanite invaders, Mosiah 9:13–19 (10:19–20). confers kingdom on son, Noah3, Mosiah 11:1.",
